&lt;p&gt;👉&lt;a href="https://williamanjo.github.io/json-pdf-designer/playground/" class="crayons-btn crayons-btn--primary" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Try the live playground →&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

