&lt;p&gt;A Yahoo account that you personally create and manage provides greater control over security and recovery settings.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Account Age Does Not Guarantee Security&lt;br&gt;
An older email account is not automatically safer or more reliable than a newly created account.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A long-established account may have:&lt;/p&gt;

