&lt;p&gt;Create and Manage Your Own Yahoo Account&lt;br&gt;
The safest long-term approach is to create and maintain an account that you personally control.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A Yahoo email account can be used for legitimate activities such as:&lt;/p&gt;

