&lt;p&gt;Avoid using easily guessed information such as names, birthdays, common phrases, or other predictable details.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Using a password manager can help create and store strong, unique passwords.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Enable Available Additional Security&lt;br&gt;
Where available, additional authentication can provide another layer of protection for account access.&lt;/p&gt;

